#: /Game/Blueprints/Vendor/A_Vendor_ArenaReward.Default__A_Vendor_ArenaReward_C.VendorCatalogue(0).VendorCatalogue.PlayerItem_50_D05B97F543ACB9F76B6D49B926DB1520.Description_96_5253D5CA4E19DDBC2A45748CC8FBC46E
msgid "Many victories deserve great rewards. Trade in for a special prize."
