msgstr "Najbliższy punkt podróży to port Diogo, ta piękna wyspa jest domem dla grzybów i rzadkich ptaków."

#. Key:	7F851A0E4F4E23CB0A7E6EAFDDE6D5EF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestTask.UMG_QuestTask_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QuestTask [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestTask.UMG_QuestTask_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QuestTask [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Loot chests near warehouses and harbours and bunkers to find gun parts and craft a gun."
msgstr "Lootuj skrzynie w pobliżu magazynów, portów i schronów, aby znaleźć części do broni i skonstruować broń."

#. Key:	876D9980426C56B800263C86769B76EA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestTask.UMG_QuestTask_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QuestTask [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestTask.UMG_QuestTask_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QuestTask [Script Bytecode]
